{"translation-revision-date":"2025-02-05 09:17-0500","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.11.0","source":"dist\/js\/interface.LOAN.gpl.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"en":["da"],"Please use the backspace key to delete.":["Brug venligst backspace-tasten til at slette."],"Left, up & down arrow keys are disabled. So are the home, end, pgup and pgdn keys.":["Piletasterne til venstre, op og ned er deaktiveret. Det samme g\u00e6lder tasterne home, end, pgup og pgdn."],"Use backspace to delete.":["Brug backspace for at slette."],"If value is selected, just start typing new value to clear prior value.":["Hvis v\u00e6rdien er valgt, skal du blot begynde at skrive en ny v\u00e6rdi for at slette den tidligere v\u00e6rdi."],"When a number is selected (value shown in inverse), use right arrow key to clear selection without clearing value. Then backspace to edit.":["N\u00e5r et tal er valgt (v\u00e6rdien vises omvendt), kan du bruge h\u00f8jre piletast til at slette valget uden at slette v\u00e6rdien. Brug derefter backspace for at redigere."],"TIP: Generally it is best to use the TAB or SHIFT-TAB keys to move from one input to the next or previous input.":["TIP: Generelt er det bedst at bruge TAB- eller SHIFT-TAB-tasterne til at g\u00e5 fra en indtastning til den n\u00e6ste eller forrige indtastning."],"TIP 2: Generally, editing a value is inefficient. Since values are auto selected, just type the number you want.":["TIP 2: Generelt er det ineffektivt at redigere en v\u00e6rdi. Da v\u00e6rdier er automatisk valgte, skal du blot skrive det \u00f8nskede tal."],"Do not type the thousand separator character.":["Du m\u00e5 ikke skrive tusindseparatoren."],"(If using U.S. convention, that would be the comma.)":["(Hvis der anvendes amerikansk konvention, ville det v\u00e6re kommaet.)"],"I'm smart enough to enter them for you!":["Jeg er smart nok til at indtaste dem for dig!"],"An unknown date calculation error occurred.":["Der er opst\u00e5et en ukendt fejl i beregningen af en dato."],"Please provide us with your inputs and settings so that we can fix this. Thank you.":["Giv os venligst dine input og indstillinger, s\u00e5 vi kan l\u00f8se dette problem. Tak."],"Date is not valid - bad year.":["Datoen er ikke gyldig - d\u00e5rligt \u00e5rstal."],"Jan":["Jan"],"Feb":["Feb"],"Mar":["Mar"],"Apr":["Apr"],"May":["Maj"],"Jun":["Jun"],"Jul":["Jul"],"Aug":["Aug"],"Sept":["Sep"],"Oct":["Okt"],"Nov":["Nov"],"Dec":["dec."],"Error: dates out of sequence.":["Fejl: datoer i forkert r\u00e6kkef\u00f8lge."],"Exception":["Undtagelse"],"occurred when accessing":["opstod ved adgang til"],"Invalid index":["Ugyldigt indeks"],"Unknown":["Ukendt"],"u":["u"],"U":["U"],"Internal limit reached. Balance exceeds +\/- 99 trillion.":["Intern gr\u00e6nse er n\u00e5et. Saldoen overstiger +\/- 99 billioner."],"YTD":["\u00c5TD"],"Running Totals":["L\u00f8bende totaler"],"Normal":["Normal"],"Your Personalized Loan Schedule":["Din personlige l\u00e5neplan"],"Last payment amount decreased by":["Sidste betalingsbel\u00f8b er faldet med"],"due to rounding":["p\u00e5 grund af afrunding"],"Last payment amount increased by":["Sidste betalingsbel\u00f8b forh\u00f8jet med"],"Loan Summary":["L\u00e5neresum\u00e9"],"Loan Amount":["L\u00e5nebel\u00f8b"],"Number of Payments":["Antal betalinger"],"Annual Interest Rate":["\u00c5rlig rentesats"],"Periodic Payment":["Periodisk afdrag"],"Loan Date":["Udl\u00e5nsdato"],"1st Payment Due":["1. betaling forfalder"],"Payment Frequency":["Betalingsfrekvens"],"Last Payment Due":["Sidste betaling forfalder"],"Total Interest Due":["Renter i alt"],"Total All Payments":["Alle betalinger i alt"],"Payment Schedule":["Betalingsplan"],"Year":["\u00c5r"],"Date":["Dato"],"Payment":["Afdrag"],"Interest":["Rente"],"Principal":["Hovedstol"],"Balance":["Saldo"],"Calculation method: Normal":["Beregningsmetode: Normal"],"Total Principal":["Hovedstol i alt"],"Total Interest":["Renter i alt"],"Pct. of Total Payments":["Pct. af de samlede betalinger"],"Annual Principal and Interest Totals":["\u00c5rlige hovedstols- og rentebel\u00f8b i alt"],"Accumulated Principal and Interest with Remaining Balance":["Akkumuleret hovedstol og renter med restsaldo"],"Total Principal and Interest":["Hovedstol og renter i alt"],"Loan":["L\u00e5n"],"There are too many unknown values.":["Der er for mange ukendte v\u00e6rdier."],"Enter \"Loan Amount\", \"Number of Payments\" and \"Annual Interest Rate\".":["Indtast \"L\u00e5nebel\u00f8b\", \"Antal afdrag\" og \"\u00c5rlig rentesats\"."],"<strong>Loan Calculator Help...<\/strong>":["<strong>Hj\u00e6lp til l\u00e5neberegner...<\/strong>"],"<p>Using the calculator is straightforward. User enters a &quot;loan amount&quot;, &quot;number of months&quot;, &quot;annual interest rate&quot;. The calculator calculates the monthly payment amount.<\/p>":["<p>At bruge beregneren er enkelt. Brugeren indtaster et &quot;l\u00e5nebel\u00f8b&quot;, &quot;antal m\u00e5neder&quot;, &quot;\u00e5rlig rentesats&quot;. Beregneren beregner det m\u00e5nedlige betalingsbel\u00f8b.<\/p>"],"<p>The &quot;Payment Method&quot; determines when the first payment is due. With the default selection, &quot;End-of-Period&quot;, the first payment will be due one month after the loan is made. If &quot;Start-of-Period&quot; is selected, then the first payment will be due on the loan date.<\/p>":["<p>\"Betaling hvorn\u00e5r\" bestemmer, hvorn\u00e5r den f\u00f8rste betaling forfalder. Med standardvalget &quot;Slutningen af perioden&quot; vil den f\u00f8rste betaling forfalde en m\u00e5ned efter l\u00e5net er optaget. Hvis &quot;Starten af perioden&quot; v\u00e6lges, vil den f\u00f8rste betaling forfalde p\u00e5 l\u00e5nedatoen.<\/p>"],"<p class=\"tail\">The term (duration) of the loan is expressed as a number of months.<\/p>":["<p class=\"tail\">L\u00e5nets l\u00f8betid er angivet som et antal m\u00e5neder.<\/p>"],"<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 months = &nbsp;5 years<\/li><li>120 months = 10 years<\/li><li>180 months = 15 years<\/li><li>240 months = 20 years<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 months = 30 years<\/li><\/ul>":["<ul class=\"mono tail\"><li>&nbsp;60 m\u00e5neder = &nbsp;5 \u00e5r<\/li><li>120 m\u00e5neder = 10 \u00e5r<\/li><li>180 m\u00e5neder = 15 \u00e5r<\/li><li>240 m\u00e5neder = 20 \u00e5r<\/li><li class=\"tail\">360 m\u00e5neder = 30 \u00e5r<\/li><\/ul>"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Set the dates? Set or change the payment and compounding frequencies? Print the schedule? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Brug for flere muligheder, herunder at kunne l\u00f8se for andre ukendte? Indstille datoerne? Indstille eller \u00e6ndre betalings- og rentesamlingsfrekvenserne? Udskrive planen? Eksportere til MS Word&trade; (.docx) eller MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) filer? Bes\u00f8g venligst <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Dates must be the first of the month.":["Datoer skal v\u00e6re den f\u00f8rste i m\u00e5neden."],"An invalid JavaScript date object.":["Et ugyldigt JavaScript-datoobjekt."],"Monthly":["M\u00e5nedlig"],"<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Need more options including the ability to solve for other unknowns? Set the dates? Set or change the payment and compounding frequencies? Print the charts? Export to MS Word&trade; (.docx) or MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) files? Please visit, <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>":["<p class=\"small\" style=\"font-size: 85%; line-height: 1.5; color:red; user-select: text\">Brug for flere muligheder, herunder at kunne l\u00f8se for andre ukendte? Indstille datoerne? Indstille eller \u00e6ndre betalings- og rentesamlingsfrekvenserne? Udskrive diagrammerne? Eksportere til MS Word&trade; (.docx) eller MS Excel&trade; (.xlsx) filer? Bes\u00f8g venligst <b>https:\/\/accuratecalculators.com\/loan-calculator<\/b><\/p>"],"Prepared for":["Forberedt til"],"Address":["Adresse"],"City, State  ZIP":["By, Region, Postnummer"],"Prepared On":["Forberedt den"],"Prepared by":["Forberederens navn"],"Phone":["Telefon"],"Email":["E-mail"],"Website":["Hjemmeside"]}}}